Package: PhysioOpenSim
Title: Native OpenSim C++ Integration for PhysioExperiment
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "matsui.yusuke.bioinfo@gmail.com")
Description: Provides a native OpenSim C++ bridge for R via Rcpp.
    The package exposes OpenSim model-level operations to support
    biomechanics workflows in the Physio ecosystem. OpenSim linkage is
    optional at build time; when OpenSim is not detected, the package
    installs with informative runtime errors for OpenSim-dependent calls.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    Rcpp
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    withr,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
